meta {
  name: List TACOTS onboarded dropdown
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lookup/tacots-onboarded
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List TACOTS Onboarded Students Dropdown

  Returns a lightweight list of TACOTS onboarded students for use in tracking and exit form dropdown/select components. Joins `tacots_onboarding` with `tacots_recommendation` to resolve student names and school information. Each entry contains the student `id`, `name` (first name + surname), and `schoolName`.

  ## Authorization
  No authentication required. This is a public lookup endpoint.

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns an array of `{ id, name, schoolName }` objects for onboarded TACOTS students.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "students found successfully",
    "data": [
      { "id": "uuid", "name": "Alice Wonderland", "schoolName": "Greenfield Academy" }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```

  | Field        | Type     | Description                                             |
  |--------------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `id`         | `string` | The onboarding record UUID.                             |
  | `name`       | `string` | Full name (first name + surname) from recommendation.   |
  | `schoolName` | `string` | School name from the linked recommendation record.      |

  ## Caching
  Response is cached under `cedarrise:lookup:onboarded` with `LISTS` TTL (10 mins).

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description              |
  |-----------------------------|--------------------------|
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
